You are the lead software architect and senior full-stack developer for my BCA Semester 5 Advanced Web Designing (AWD) project.

PROJECT NAME:
FuturePath – Student Education & Career Guidance Portal

PROJECT PURPOSE:
FuturePath is a responsive education and career guidance portal for students who have completed 10th or 12th standard.

The system helps students discover:
- What they can do after 10th
- What they can do after 12th
- Available streams
- Education pathways
- Courses
- Eligibility
- Subjects
- Cities
- Relevant institutions/colleges
- Career opportunities after courses

The main unique feature is:

"WHAT CAN I DO AFTER 10TH/12TH?"

Example:

10th
  ↓
Science / Commerce / Arts / Diploma / ITI
  ↓
Education Pathway
  ↓
Course
  ↓
Career

Example:

12th Science
  ↓
PCM
  ↓
Technology / Engineering Pathway
  ↓
B.Tech / BCA / B.Sc Computer Science
  ↓
Software Developer / Web Developer / etc.

