API DESIGN
==================================================

Use RESTful API conventions.

Examples:

/api/auth
/api/users
/api/qualifications
/api/streams
/api/pathways
/api/courses
/api/cities
/api/institutions
/api/careers

Use appropriate HTTP status codes:

200 → successful GET/UPDATE
201 → successful CREATE
400 → validation/bad request
401 → unauthorized
403 → forbidden
404 → resource not found
409 → duplicate/conflict
500 → server error

Use consistent JSON responses.

Success:

{
  "success": true,
  "message": "...",
  "data": {}
}

List:

{
  "success": true,
  "count": 0,
  "data": []
}

Error:

{
  "success": false,
  "message": "..."
}

